Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.52,0:01:10.53,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Truth
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:14.26,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Is elusive, it's nowhere to be found
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.95,0:01:18.05,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Yea the truth can never be written down
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.05,0:01:21.11,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}It's not in any magazine
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.11,0:01:25.70,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You can't see it on your TV screen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.08,0:01:26.91,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Truth
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.43,0:01:30.87,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Is evasive though you might have the facts
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.52,0:01:34.64,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Got it straight, you think but then it all cracks
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.64,0:01:39.02,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Wide open, you can search the world far and wide
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.02,0:01:42.62,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}The only truth that you can ever find
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.62,0:01:43.33,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Is
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.98,0:01:45.88,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}In another
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.54,0:01:50.03,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}A soul that's got the same burning need
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.45,0:01:52.14,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To find out what's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.19,0:01:54.05,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Neath the cover-up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.97,0:01:56.92,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}The one can't be without the true other
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.92,0:01:59.18,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}So let's get together, see what we can uncover
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.27,0:02:00.12,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}One
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.48,0:02:02.57,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That defines your world
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.61,0:02:04.98,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Gives you truth and life
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.51,0:02:08.36,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}One
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.76,0:02:10.18,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That excels
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.50,0:02:15.90,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Special enough to guide your way through
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.49,0:02:18.60,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}This 暗影 world
