Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.61,0:17:35.92,ed,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}He's standing right in your shoes
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.07,0:17:39.71,ed,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}And you feel like you're in his too
