Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.92,0:18:23.84,ed,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}It's right there
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.91,0:18:25.81,ed,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}For you to grab your
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.95,0:18:28.46,ed,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Next Chance to become
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.44,0:18:32.00,ed,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Whatever you want
